  "task": {
    "objective": "Deliver the three finite cargo boats to basin 3 while irrigating each indexed crop twice or recording its loss. Each role benefits especially from its same-index cargo and crop; sharing and bridge access affect all roles.",
    "natural_termination": "All three boats delivered and every crop either has two doses or zero health. Otherwise the horizon is 160 live transitions. A dead crop remains an explicit negative outcome.",
    "interaction": "A gate simultaneously controls a walking bridge, one conserved delayed water packet, and boat passage. Irrigation and emergency drainage remove water needed for later downstream cargo. Close votes veto opens. Shared crop and spill allocations rotate by t modulo three.",
    "observation_access": "Fully observable. Each role receives its identity and the complete public dynamic state and tile layout. Fixed active/visibility arrays are public constants; boat activity is exactly the complement of the observed delivered flag. Static entity positions are included or directly determined by observed node identity."
  },
